  "coverage": {
    "implemented": [
      "offline_claim acknowledges only the current GameSession offline report ID and cannot advance time or grant rewards",
      "research catalog lookup, DAG/dependency gates, level cap, exact canonical total-cost accounting and OI spend",
      "A02-A20 dialogue-read gates, explicit canonical-trigger checks, story archive and one-time final sample",
      "deterministic paid geology reports, report tags, and source-visible proposed rewards",
      "resource-reserved contracts with separate ship and one-time claim actions",
      "timed buildings with upfront cash, reserved materials, and completion-time consumption",
      "Fe/Pd/Ir expansion eligibility from historical average level and actual mined delta; local reset preserves global profile state",
      "offline upgrade cap and shard schedule; offline elapsed-time ownership belongs to GameSession"
    ],
    "partial": [
      "site expansion cancellation is owned by the parent GameSession/SiteModel; the progression model only resets local upgrades and preserves pending output state",
      "D01-D04 are named feature flags only; precision, bonus-pocket, forecast, and marked-strike gameplay hooks are not consumed by EconomyModel",
      "all other canonical research effect prose is catalog-only until concrete runtime hooks are implemented",
      "mastery ranks and milestone gates persist, but effects remain descriptive and mastery-point source is an explicit proposal",
      "safe_repair cost/timer are proposed values required for the A02 gate, not canonical economy data",
      "story trigger evidence uses current stats and deterministic report tags; document/media interactions are not modeled"
    ],
